       46     .
       47   define temp-table tt-rest no-undo
       48     field artic         like ub.parts.artic
       49     field part-code     as character
       50     field in-code       as character
       51     field gds-code      like ub.gds-obj.gds-code
       52     field prc_rubl      as decimal
       53     field sum_rubl      as decimal
       54     field fact-qnty     as decimal
       55     field vat-tax-value as decimal
       56     field name-gtd      as character
       57     field srok-god      as character
       58     field supp-code     as integer
       59     field supp-type     like ub.parts.supp-type
       60     field contract-code as integer
       61     index pi is primary in-code
       62     index i-supp supp-code contract-code
       63     index i-gds gds-code
